  "clips": [
    {
      "file": "ru/CH05_P04_L001_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L001",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Мы обнаружили огромные гравитационные туннели и научились связывать их между собой.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 5520,
      "sha256": "a3b3b3f1a73adab61e396defcaf23a4cc18e35d3516b9bd45a8b8ef9d8b079f8"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH05_P04_L002_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L002",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F02",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Когда мы давным-давно прибыли в этот мир, местные существа помогли нам освоиться. Мы до сих пор поддерживаем с ними связь.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 7520,
      "sha256": "04f4a972f480b8374d333d8116106a0c1871f8f06558abbda068a439a709d602"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH05_P04_L003_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L003",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F03",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Недавно мы получили от них сигнал: они попросили открыть туннель из твоего мира в наш.",
      "emotion_tag": "[serious]",
      "duration_ms": 5520,
      "sha256": "b130547bd45d7314c24ed9064951f8024fbaa82ce995f2e6ecc4e5792c230367"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH05_P04_L004_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L004",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F04",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Мы открыли проход и стали ждать, к чему это приведёт. А вскоре появился ты.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 5840,
      "sha256": "b42b8bee49c0df4253914df5ad2b9a1516074f17ca7c018d0672ccd25e7bbab8"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH05_P04_L005_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L005",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F05",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "Мы решили: я полечу с вами и помогу добраться до этих существ. Они подскажут, зачем спасли тебя.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 6800,
      "sha256": "5dceae8f7f3e1d1ebf313d091300502bf71a715e623af5155077dd6c2b080f04"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH05_P04_L006_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L006",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Спасибо!",
      "emotion_tag": "[grateful]",
      "duration_ms": 1360,
      "sha256": "a123f0bb77de97baa9e033885bd9404a2c53710b1e007caffcb89938b01650b1"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH05_P04_L007_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L007",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F06",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Магнитный друг полетел с экипажем и указал путь в неизвестную Мике часть космоса — к его спасителям.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 6880,
      "sha256": "06b3d6b76c3a6e2f68014b8b18bdab33dbd1d242fdcf3766a078ad6df5ddef9a"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH05_P04_L001_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L001",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "We discovered vast gravitational tunnels and learned to connect them to one another.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 5040,
      "sha256": "1e80025281b0d725292a09859ad3cd6311e85397482322067f119526613b8c42"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH05_P04_L002_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L002",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F02",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Long ago, when we arrived in this world, its inhabitants helped us settle in. We still keep in touch with them.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 6880,
      "sha256": "ab4b021958a7e97683906da380bf8511333f2879c67b09567060333d0b8906dc"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH05_P04_L003_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L003",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F03",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Recently, they sent us a signal asking us to open a tunnel from your world to ours.",
      "emotion_tag": "[serious]",
      "duration_ms": 5200,
      "sha256": "acc558514e48806facc95e4e6e9e381c4ef904bb6261088652015d4cd983b2d0"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH05_P04_L004_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L004",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F04",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "We opened the passage and waited to see what would happen. And then you appeared.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 5040,
      "sha256": "c2a3eea68596f54fc969f9e042bf86d211c07a2b63eb3ece77f1b9839f422b5f"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH05_P04_L005_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L005",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F05",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "We decided: I will travel with you and help you reach these beings. They can tell us why they saved you.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 6400,
      "sha256": "406088c82cdbf1ed6989e6348921bc7512bf6406258dc8726436bc78043efc07"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH05_P04_L006_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L006",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Thank you!",
      "emotion_tag": "[grateful]",
      "duration_ms": 1360,
      "sha256": "57ab0eb9e063df2863a2b5f0f20fe9be3d988f01f015068783bf3688c87c6e5d"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH05_P04_L007_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L007",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F06",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Our magnetic friend joined the crew and guided the ship into a part of space Mika had never seen, toward those who had saved him.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 8080,
      "sha256": "3a5c03086b1d7e464ff56e28854d33d32ab3d7866896bf47fe74c79d74669fd2"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH05_P04_L001_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L001",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Descobrimos enormes túneis gravitacionais e aprendemos a conectá-los entre si.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 5200,
      "sha256": "d9c07256532b6e02663215a25c1e3d8b5ac04f5e213871825b88e4d80b4d35bd"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH05_P04_L002_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L002",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F02",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Há muito tempo, quando chegamos a este mundo, seus habitantes nos ajudaram a nos adaptar. Ainda mantemos contato com eles.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 7520,
      "sha256": "bfbdea6041bc6795b29010953598662cbf5ef69432c6606d2719af3cdd53ed5b"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH05_P04_L003_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L003",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F03",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Recentemente, recebemos um sinal deles: pediram que abríssemos um túnel do seu mundo para o nosso.",
      "emotion_tag": "[serious]",
      "duration_ms": 6480,
      "sha256": "4c70720e7b53bfbb9998c4bb064c5d807423f61952a4e288fd0576b279cf72d4"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH05_P04_L004_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L004",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F04",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Abrimos a passagem e esperamos para ver o que aconteceria. E então você apareceu.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 5680,
      "sha256": "f938a194afbfa335bb228427e836cdfd5809f776eace6f089ffef2e73f4cff3c"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH05_P04_L005_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L005",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F05",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "Decidimos: vou viajar com vocês e ajudá-los a chegar até esses seres. Eles poderão explicar por que salvaram você.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 7360,
      "sha256": "78fda571b8b42310b1507b37ab1fcc174e95bf8af99dbe0ba88406d4b0fed8a8"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH05_P04_L006_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L006",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Obrigado!",
      "emotion_tag": "[grateful]",
      "duration_ms": 1360,
      "sha256": "407f959c7b2404419823363ecd218da1f22fb7cd666800964868880d7a470801"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH05_P04_L007_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L007",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F06",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Nosso amigo magnético se juntou à tripulação e guiou a nave por uma região do espaço desconhecida para Mika, rumo àqueles que o salvaram.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 8640,
      "sha256": "7cb0a6884d7787818e74c854ad52ce3422b698993fe95cb34a6daee12396f003"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P04_L001_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L001",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Descubrimos enormes túneles gravitatorios y aprendimos a conectarlos entre sí.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 5360,
      "sha256": "0ee524e61919594a664bcb0f6ae195da3f7c96081155c3d7c74c51b4d518b324"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P04_L002_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L002",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F02",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Hace muchísimo tiempo, cuando llegamos a este mundo, sus habitantes nos ayudaron a adaptarnos. Todavía seguimos en contacto con ellos.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 8720,
      "sha256": "5a7f027abe6e00d8eaff08f82f43d22f22c8582243f7b2e6428b4cabba77da17"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P04_L003_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L003",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F03",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Hace poco nos enviaron una señal: nos pidieron abrir un túnel desde tu mundo hasta el nuestro.",
      "emotion_tag": "[serious]",
      "duration_ms": 5600,
      "sha256": "163bd8c2fdde5481acf42e54d5653cb32b1e4389aaa7193773f958aeb6c97fca"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P04_L004_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L004",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F04",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Abrimos el paso y esperamos a ver qué ocurría. Y entonces apareciste tú.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 5120,
      "sha256": "aefee314ef2a636a028ddfbc3cf751adb100d7da23b6703d2eaa2e1bb505e7a4"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P04_L005_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L005",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F05",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "Lo hemos decidido: viajaré con ustedes y los ayudaré a llegar hasta esos seres. Podrán explicar por qué te salvaron.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 7440,
      "sha256": "4432278279896a70e09e951a59bec2ec426fcdc6b2bad533faa423fa6cefed7b"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P04_L006_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L006",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "¡Gracias!",
      "emotion_tag": "[grateful]",
      "duration_ms": 1280,
      "sha256": "4a5661f8dd124386fe113969421c68ef071e1d1b41bd94c90ee26c445de128c0"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH05_P04_L007_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L007",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F06",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Nuestro amigo magnético se unió a la tripulación y guio la nave hacia una región del espacio desconocida para Mika, rumbo a sus salvadores.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 8560,
      "sha256": "5441548e5eb1df345b7db72173663e1ed016f5c37b51b973abfc67f9244c5ee3"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P04_L001_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L001",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Nous avons découvert d’immenses tunnels gravitationnels et appris à les relier entre eux.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 4960,
      "sha256": "cc0075838e9ff201045a08b2d77a2728578db6f1a72ba356a3391609c99c0fa3"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P04_L002_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L002",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F02",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Il y a très longtemps, quand nous sommes arrivés dans ce monde, ses habitants nous ont aidés à nous adapter. Nous sommes toujours en contact avec eux.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 7600,
      "sha256": "570fdbfb67a86c5abf72d1235a031e5fb128e80e6332dce4666eaeb9144f5544"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P04_L003_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L003",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F03",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Récemment, ils nous ont envoyé un signal pour nous demander d’ouvrir un tunnel entre ton monde et le nôtre.",
      "emotion_tag": "[serious]",
      "duration_ms": 5680,
      "sha256": "196c65bd7f4faa800954bc451542ddd1bc0b1a387edb688f88719ca913152337"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P04_L004_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L004",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F04",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Nous avons ouvert le passage, puis attendu de voir ce qui se produirait. Et c’est alors que tu es apparu.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 5920,
      "sha256": "b4ef9bcce79994812dd46f11d0a5e35c757d9310e847d20b5e3e4d14e5b9c0e7"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P04_L005_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L005",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F05",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "Nous avons décidé que je partirais avec vous pour vous aider à les rejoindre. Ils pourront expliquer pourquoi ils t’ont sauvé.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 6320,
      "sha256": "ef5fdea70f7de63007bff64d2e9735c262c906b8147a3cc4ca182a4d8bcea475"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P04_L006_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L006",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Merci !",
      "emotion_tag": "[grateful]",
      "duration_ms": 1280,
      "sha256": "3c7c35723e4abc8ce2c32d3422173de6b58233c9b292cb3d150a06ded7d37b22"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH05_P04_L007_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L007",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F06",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Notre ami magnétique a rejoint l’équipage et guidé le vaisseau vers une région de l’espace inconnue de Mika, à la rencontre de ses sauveurs.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 7600,
      "sha256": "41f8a5f7ced81b397317fd8a826f91f6ea40b662f6c33eae17dcc26037ad7107"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P04_L001_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L001",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Wir entdeckten riesige Gravitationstunnel und lernten, sie miteinander zu verbinden.",
      "emotion_tag": "[awe]",
      "duration_ms": 5280,
      "sha256": "94628d126c422b35e20bb2b3714c6b5220162153fc3f93422926eed63b87c868"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P04_L002_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L002",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F02",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Als wir vor langer Zeit in diese Welt kamen, halfen uns ihre Bewohner, uns hier zurechtzufinden. Bis heute stehen wir mit ihnen in Kontakt.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtful]",
      "duration_ms": 7600,
      "sha256": "77ad43f2d7308008fd2178c65b627c7ab53ec9ccc59657ed5406c2f2dc9613aa"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P04_L003_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L003",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F03",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Vor Kurzem erhielten wir ihr Signal: Sie baten uns, einen Tunnel von deiner Welt in unsere zu öffnen.",
      "emotion_tag": "[serious]",
      "duration_ms": 6400,
      "sha256": "f894089fabf4dc12d4a1b6099b62b8b94dd115eb04d4feb49f2abf83aee41998"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P04_L004_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L004",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F04",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_037",
      "role": "central_archive",
      "kind": "archive_narration",
      "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
      "text": "Wir öffneten den Durchgang und warteten ab, was geschehen würde. Dann bist du aufgetaucht.",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 5680,
      "sha256": "0e85b0e88917be9234336ac3dce807fa9a901359b953f538b851d59c832f9d03"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P04_L005_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L005",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F05",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "role": "magnetic_companion_host",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "EST9Ui6982FZPSi7gCHi",
      "text": "Wir haben beschlossen: Ich fliege mit euch und helfe euch, diese Wesen zu finden. Sie können uns erklären, warum sie dich gerettet haben.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confident]",
      "duration_ms": 7520,
      "sha256": "afd0f0d77e3d61417bf3c7d46ef406fa2117c17f6e270e70b00a2b63d3735642"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P04_L006_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L006",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F05",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Danke!",
      "emotion_tag": "[grateful]",
      "duration_ms": 1200,
      "sha256": "63e7f455c060b6328b7d8ef31dc912858454acca6216d7aa8de3949bf7d5b32a"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH05_P04_L007_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH05_P04_L007",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P04_F06",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Unser magnetischer Freund schloss sich der Besatzung an und führte das Raumschiff in einen Teil des Alls, den Mika nicht kannte — auf dem Weg zu seinen Rettern.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 8720,
      "sha256": "18b1d06172b802955386e7dd538c70cce4e7777dc660304e0b7a2ae0bfa9d51f"
    }
  ],
